# Just Do It

When the user invokes JD or asks you to autonomously finish a complex multi-phase goal, read and
follow `.cursor/skills/jd/SKILL.md`. Treat its linked references as part of the contract.

Inventory Cursor's available agent, sandbox, review, and resume capabilities before delegation.
Do not claim named Codex roles, durable background supervision, independent review, or external
delivery unless the current Cursor runtime proves them. Preserve JD's authority envelope,
test-first loop, redacted ledger, explicit delivery modes, and no-auto-merge rule.
